    m_Localized: EMPTY - dock the cyan coupling at the free water source
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659048
    m_Localized: Grip the handle; squeeze to fire.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659049
    m_Localized: 'Mouse: spray | H: water station | C: creek | B: shop'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659050
    m_Localized: 'GRASP the gold top handle / other hand: cyan nozzle.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659051
    m_Localized: SQUEEZE grip to charge / or grasp cyan pump, pull, release.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659052
    m_Localized: 'TAKE OWNED TOOL below. B: shop between incidents. 1-4: owned gear.'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659053
    m_Localized: REFILL - cannon needs at least 8 water
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659054
    m_Localized: GRASP the top handle to spray / GRASP with the other hand to transfer
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659055
    m_Localized: 'OPEN this hand, then GRASP the top handle / other hand: GRASP to
      transfer'
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659056
    m_Localized: GRASP the nozzle with your other hand to aim
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659057
    m_Localized: RELAX the top hand once, then SQUEEZE to spray. Your tool stays
      held.
    m_Metadata:
      m_Items: []
  - m_Id: 1103659058
    m_Localized: SQUEEZE to spray / RELAX to stop / OPEN PALM to float / re-grasp
      within 5 seconds
